1
00:00:00,376 --> 00:00:02,246
(Alex:)All right. I will tell him you called.

2
00:00:04,681 --> 00:00:06,611
- Hmm. That's weird.
- What?

3
00:00:07,383 --> 00:00:10,083
(Amy:)Sheldon told me
he had a new assistant named Alex.

4
00:00:10,253 --> 00:00:12,183
(Amy:)He didn't mention that Alex was a girl.

5
00:00:12,388 --> 00:00:14,758
(Penny:)Maybe he didn't notice.

6
00:00:15,291 --> 00:00:17,661
(Amy:)You're right.
I don't have to worry about Sheldon.

7
00:00:17,827 --> 00:00:20,297
(Penny:)No, you do not.

8
00:00:22,532 --> 00:00:24,162
(Amy:)It's her I have to worry about.

9
00:00:24,334 --> 00:00:27,774
(Penny:)Oh. Amy, really?
She is not gonna come on to Sheldon.

10
00:00:27,937 --> 00:00:29,027
(Amy:)Oh, really?

11
00:00:29,205 --> 00:00:31,265
(Amy:)Look at this face.

12
00:00:34,143 --> 00:00:37,273
(Amy:)How can any woman spend eight hours
a day alone with this face...

13
00:00:37,447 --> 00:00:39,917
(Amy:)...and not fall in love with it?

14
00:00:40,984 --> 00:00:44,924
(Penny:)Well, for starters, at some point,
that face starts talking.

15
00:00:50,693 --> 00:00:53,563
(Penny:)Amy, this is crazy.
You have nothing to be suspicious about.

16
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:54,790
(Amy:)I'm not suspicious.

17
00:00:54,964 --> 00:00:59,024
I just wanna stop in, say hi to my boyfriend,
and meet his new assistant.

